This project modifies the architecture to remove Transformers dependencies,
provide an explicit request-owned KV cache, integrate ComfyUI model management,
and expose native text generation. Upstream model weights are not bundled.

Additional changes include input-span/owner attention control in prefill and
decode, owner-aware MoE dispatch and repetition history, independent character
expansion with a shared caption, source-preserving tag guards, and RS pipe/UI
integration. The learned caption-to-tag format was consulted in KGen
(KohakuBlueleaf/KGen, Apache-2.0); KGen is not bundled as an inference dependency.

The model card for the pinned TIPO-v2.1 checkpoint identifies weight terms as
Kohaku License 1.0. Architecture attribution does not license the model weights.
See docs/references.md for exact sources, revisions and adaptation boundaries.

